*_drive_suggestions.geojson
*_drive_route.gpx

# FCC claims comparison outputs (mukoo-claims writes these to ~/mukoo).
# Full-precision, per-measurement violation traces stay LOCAL — only the
# hex-level aggregate (verizon_claim_violations_by_hex.geojson) is published.
*claims_report.json
*claims_violations.geojson
verizon_claim_violations.geojson
